{"id":"n80191-2-5","stage":4,"title":"차곡차곡 · 井然有序地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80191-2-5-1","ko":"있잖아, 그게, 어제 그랬었잖아.","zh":"你知道的，就是啊，昨天不是发生过那种事吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"있잖아,","meaning":"就是","explanation":"있다：就是；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"7","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있잖아","audio":"/audio/9daaa7ad7fc1d3865a65.mp3"}},{"text":"그게,","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그게","audio":"/audio/76f4738285e0cdc443f8.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"그랬었잖아.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그랬었잖아","audio":"/audio/67e2545b4db8e65be545.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"就是","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"用于强调或确认某个对象或事实。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"49ef044188dcd25e","term":"그것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3","entryId":"31953","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그걷"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5432082f0e14f52a4a6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80191-2-5-2","ko":"뭐야, 좀 차곡차곡 정리를 해서 말을 해.","zh":"喂，先好好整理一下再来说话吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐야,","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"차곡차곡","meaning":"井然有序地，有头有绪地","explanation":"차곡차곡：井然有序地，有头有绪地","readings":[{"term":"차곡차곡","audio":"/audio/82e0c67931493e2ee23a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80191","senseId":"2","lemma":"차곡차곡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차곡차곡","audio":"/audio/82e0c67931493e2ee23a.mp3"}},{"text":"정리를","meaning":"整理，收拾，清理","explanation":"정리：整理，收拾，清理；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"정리","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75781","senseId":"1","lemma":"정리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정리를","audio":"/audio/1b29198b088eae6521f2.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말을","audio":"/audio/e897e0419e4ab64902fd.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"82e0c67931493e2e","term":"차곡차곡","zh":"井然有序地，有头有绪地","audio":"/audio/82e0c67931493e2ee23a.mp3","entryId":"80191","definition":"言行缓慢而井井有序的样子。","pronunciation":["차곡차곡"]},{"id":"829a277fc72022a6","term":"정리","zh":"整理，收拾，清理","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3","entryId":"75781","definition":"将处于散乱状态的东西归整到一起或扔掉。","pronunciation":["정ː니"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/cdb4b1b95b5eadd6d179.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80191","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["喂，先好好整理一下再来说话吧。","你知道的，就是啊，昨天不是发生过那种事吗？","怎么了？头疼吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你知道的，就是啊，昨天不是发生过那种事吗？","怎么了？头疼吗？","喂，先好好整理一下再来说话吧。"],"answer":2}]}
